    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] conjures a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]]-[[lookup @target.template.units activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]]. [[lookup @target.template.type capitalize activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]] of magical Darkness originating from a point it can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]] [[lookup @range.units activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]]., which lasts for [[lookup @duration.value activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]] [[lookup @duration.units activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]] or until the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s &amp;Reference[Concentration] ends on it. This area is &amp;Reference[DifficultTerrain].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]], any [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=sIJYYjLHqCAPxOLm]] that starts its turn in this area or enters it for the first time on a turn.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the [[lookup @name lowercase]] or a creature of its choice it can see gains [[/healing activity=DXSz02tEbmOq9fOu]] Hit Points.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p>",
